  <!-- EN: Depending on ritual quality, participants will get between {MINMOOD} and {MAXMOOD} mood for {MOODDAYS} days. -->
  <AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.description>参与者将在{MOODDAYS}天内获得{MINMOOD}到{MAXMOOD}的心情值，这取决于仪式的效果。</AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.description>
  <!-- EN: moral guide present -->
  <AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.comps.0.label>传道者出席</AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!-- EN: participant count -->
  <AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.comps.1.label>参与者数量</AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.comps.1.label>
  <!-- EN: A corrupt gauranlen tree -->
  <AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.comps.2.label>腐化母树</AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.comps.2.label>
  <!-- EN: {RITUAL} was spectacular! {CORPSE} has pleased the beyond -->
  <AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.modExtensions.0.bestOutcomeDesc>{RITUAL}非常完美！{CORPSE}成功取悦了这片异目之地！</AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.modExtensions.0.bestOutcomeDesc>
  <!-- EN: {RITUAL} was a disaster! {CORPSE} has been lost forever, now we just have a mess!. -->
  <AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.modExtensions.0.worstOutcomeDesc>{RITUAL}糟糕透顶！{CORPSE}已经永远离开了我们，这可真是一团糟！</AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.modExtensions.0.worstOutcomeDesc>
  <!-- EN: Terrible -->
  <AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>糟糕的</AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was terrible! The resurrection has failed in an awful way. All that remains is this gross goo -->
  <AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>{0}非常糟糕！葬礼失败的彻彻底底，最终剩下的只有这些恶心的黏液。</AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!-- EN: Lackluster -->
  <AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>枯燥乏味的</AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was disappointing, we were hoping for more great creatures! -->
  <AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>{0}枯燥乏味。我们需要更多强大的生物！</AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!-- EN: Good -->
  <AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>令人满意的</AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was good. We were able to welcome more creatures to our glorious collection! -->
  <AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>{0}令人满意。这些生物将会成为我们的得力帮手！</AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!-- EN: Amazing -->
  <AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>令人惊异的</AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was Amazing. The ocular lands smile upon us! That body has served their true purpose! -->
  <AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>{0}令人惊异。异目之地正向我们微笑，那具尸体已成功取悦了它！</AM_OcularFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>
  
